# Project outputs — keep local, don't push to git
# Source materials ARE tracked (source/photos, source/references, source/docs)
# manifest.yaml, prompts/, notes.md in each round ARE tracked
# Generated images in rounds/*/outputs/ are NOT tracked (large, reproducible)
# selected/ symlinks ARE tracked (small, documents the curation)
# composites/ and deliverables/ are NOT tracked (large)
projects/*/rounds/*/outputs/
projects/*/composites/
projects/*/deliverables/

# Debug artifacts
*.log
debug_*.png
